              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 10:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jacwo odonjo i nywomirok gi dhako, to nwaŋere nike dhako k'osangala go, kwoŋbedo nitie koco moro i go, jacwo no wondiki rigo balwa ma pokirok, wokethi i cingi go, to riemo woko go i ot pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dheno owok i ot pere, go nyalo nywomere gi jacwo man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka jacwo ma go onywomere gine k'omaro go, to ndiko rigo balwa ma pokirok, aka omiyo go i cinge, kosa ka jacwo no otho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kenyo cwor go marapena, m'otelo riemo go, kiripi gik tero go paka dhako pere kendo, paka go otieko waco nike go koc. Kole meno labedo amien ruwaŋ Rwoth, aka wilakelo banja i lowo ma Rwoth Were mewin miyo win paka gir'alunja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
