          "text": "K'ikeco ranyak perin i ndelo perin aka wiyin owil gi mweniko man i ndelo, ikir'igiki omo, meno weyi ri japath, nyithindho kic, kodi citho, ŋey Rwoth Were perin womiy tic je ma cingin silwany. ",
